Final Answer:
Let the set of vehicle types (indexed by i) be as follows, in the order from products.csv:

1. Sedan
2. SUV
3. Truck
4. Convertible
5. Minivan
6. Coupe
7. Hatchback
8. Station Wagon
9. Electric Car
10. Hybrid Car
11. Luxury Sedan
